<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 300 million mark two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 300 million mark two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch CM Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    11.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    11.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.965    FULL FEES   0.08</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.965</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.02	SELL CONC  0.04	LISTING FEE 0.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
